  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Immunisation Strengthening and Engagement (RISE-2) (Asia Pacific)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the Regional Immunisation Strengthening and Engagement 2 (RISE-2) program, the National Centre for Immunisation Research and Surveillance (NCIRS) and the Australian Regional Immunisation Alliance (ARIA) will continue to support Pacific and Southeast Asian countries&apos; efforts to deliver safe, effective and accessible immunisation programs. The RISE-2 program aims to reduce serious vaccine-preventable diseases by strengthening their immunisation systems, particularly by increasing equitable access to and coverage of new and existing vaccines across the life course and with a gender, disability and social inclusion focus.</narrative>
  </description>
